dth=\"39\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 39.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 10.4 10.4 21.7 21.7 29.3 29.3\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » veya «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"37\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 37.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 11.3 11.3 20.3 20.3 27.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"27.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » ile mansubdur. Yâhud sonunda: o gün ne dehşettir gibi bir takdir vardır deniliyor. «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"49\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 49.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 9.7 16.4 32.2 32.2 39.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"9.7 16.4 39.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » deki nefyi zulüm ma'nayı fı'li hepsinden yakındır. Bu suâl ve cevab «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"93\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 93.5 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 12.0 12.0 18.8 27.0 48.0 48.0 58.6 65.3 72.0 72.0 78.8\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"3.0 12.0 18.8 27.0 48.0 58.6 65.3 78.8 83.3\" y=\"26.3 21.1 26.3 26.3 21.1 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » va'dînin tatbikını ve Cehennemin dehşetini ve hızını tasvirdir. İstifham takrirîdir. Ya'ni Cehennem o genişliğiyle beraber « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"290\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 289.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 13.4 20.2 20.2 27.0 36.0 36.0 48.0 63.7 78.7 85.4 85.4 92.2 99.7 106.4 123.7 123.7 130.4 130.4 137.2 137.2 150.0 150.0 157.4 173.2 183.7 183.7 199.4 208.4 208.4 215.2 223.4 244.4 244.4 255.0 261.7 268.4 268.4 275.2\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"3.0 27.0 48.0 63.7 85.4 106.4 130.4 173.2 199.4 2